# The sdist carries tests/ (setuptools' default), and what they import or read beside it:
# conftest.py (NumPy's SIMD dispatch, the header), tests/common.py, the NVRTC stub header,
# fortran/TM5ZOOM_PIN, and runs/ and analysis/ (test_fetch_fixture, test_export_public and
# test_zoom_census load scripts from them).  The wheel is pydyn/ alone.
include conftest.py fortran/TM5ZOOM_PIN tests/common.py tests/nvrtc_stub.h
include CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md
graft runs
graft analysis
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[co]
